---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../SectionHeading.astro';
import ServiceRow from '../ServiceRow.astro';
import { SERVICES } from '../../data/services';
---

<Section id="services" class="bg-navy py-24 text-pearl md:py-32 lg:py-40">
  <SectionHeading number="02" tone="dark">
    From soil to structure, from vision to execution.
  </SectionHeading>

  <div class="mt-10 flex justify-start gap-x-6">
    <p class="col-span-12 max-w-xl text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-pearl/65 md:col-span-7 md:col-start-4" data-reveal>
      I work comfortably at every scale of a property — from the smallest repair to the largest undertaking.
      I can step into a project at any stage: to help build, to restore, to manage, to maintain. I understand
      infrastructure — water systems, solar, machinery, construction, landscape, operations — moving between
      details and big picture, coordinating contractors, shaping land, refining systems, and protecting both
      property and investment. Sometimes the work is technical. Sometimes it is physical. Sometimes it is
      leadership. Often, it is all three.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-14 border-b border-pearl/15 lg:mt-20" data-reveal-group>
    {SERVICES.map((s) => (
      <ServiceRow
        number={s.number}
        title={s.title}
        description={s.summary}
        href={`/services/${s.slug}/`}
        tone="dark"
      />
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="mt-14 max-w-xl font-serif text-lg font-light italic leading-relaxed text-gold-light" data-reveal>
    No job is too small. No responsibility too large.
  </p>
</Section>
